Socket.io namespace /chat. Exemple:
const socket = io("http://localhost:3000/chat", { extraHeaders: { Authorization: "Bearer {{token}}" } });
socket.emit("join", "conv_1");
socket.emit("message:send", { conversationId: "conv_1", content: "Hello!" });
socket.emit("typing:start", "conv_1");
socket.emit("message:read", "conv_1");

Socket.io namespace /notifications. Le client doit envoyer le JWT.
Exemple:
const socket = io("http://localhost:3000/notifications", { extraHeaders: { Authorization: "Bearer {{token}}" } });
socket.on("notification:new", (n) => console.log(n));
socket.on("notification:unread_count", (p) => console.log(p));

Namespace /time. Exemple client:
const socket = io("http://localhost:3000/time", { extraHeaders: { Authorization: "Bearer {{token}}" } });
socket.on("timer:state", (t) => console.log(t));

